  <section class="card">
    <div class="head">Immediate response rules</div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="badBox">
        If a customer has an M-PESA receipt but the order is still pending, do not ask the customer to pay again. Capture evidence, check reconciliation, check Render logs, and handle the order manually until the callback issue is understood.
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
